  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>Glide, fight, and decide in a surreal narrative action RPG.</b><p></p>\n<p>Step into the role of Dreamer, navigating a dystopian megastructure on the edge of digital ascension. Battle cultists and voidspawn in deliberate sword combat, glide across impossible ruins, and uncover conspiracies that blur the line between machine, cult, and void.</p>\n<p><b>HYPERxFANTASY</b> blends exploration, directional swordplay, and non-linear storytelling into a single strange and cinematic adventure. It’s a <b>full-length journey of 8+ hours</b> where your choices — and your perception of the world itself — shape what unfolds.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Glide across vast surreal landscapes</b> and uncover hidden routes.\n</li><li><b>Master deliberate sword combat</b> against wretches, voidspawn, and corrupted sentinels.\n</li><li><b>Shape the narrative</b> through branching dialogue and difficult choices.\n</li><li><b>Break expectations</b> with rhythm sequences, puzzles, and meta twists.\n</li><li><b>A full-length adventure</b> (~8–12 hours on first playthrough).\n</li><li><b>Replay for multiple endings</b> and consequences that change everything.\n</li></ul>\n",
